<title>USA: Armstrong Schools, Pa., adjusted maturities, TIC.</title>
<headline>Armstrong Schools, Pa., adjusted maturities, TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milt Lopus Associates, Inc, financial advisor to the Armstrong School District, Pa., said it revised the maturity amounts and recalculated Prudential Securities Inc's winning bid for the District's $17.440 million bond issue.  Prudential's winning true interest cost is 5.1744 percent reflecting the cost of bond insurance, not the 5.1573 percent originally calculated.</p>
</text>
